      "claim": "If the judge finds the notification limb cannot be established at all on an artifact impaired to weight 0.4 — so that the case fits neither row (a) nor row (b) of POL-RD-24 — the consequence is escalation under POL-GEN-26, not a refund: the open question is stated and the fare is held while a human reviews it, because ESCALATE issues no monetary outcome and replaces any ruling (POL-GEN-03). An escalated fare is not a returned fare, and on this record there is no basis for any order that returns the trip fare to the rider.",
      "side": "DRIVER",
